# ==============================================================================
# TIO ContainerTyped Extension
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   This file extends TM Forum Intent Ontology (TIO) v3.6.0 with semantic
#   classification for container-typed entities (values that are or produce
#   rdfs:Container instances).
#
# Rationale:
#   TIO 3.6.0 requires validating Container types in multiple places:
#   - icm:chooseFrom must be rdfs:Container or function returning Container
#   - icm:reportTriggers must be rdfs:Container
#   - icm:reportDestinations must be rdfs:Container
#   - Set functions expect rdfs:Container arguments
#
#   Currently this requires complex SPARQL with multiple FILTER NOT EXISTS
#   patterns to check both explicit typing AND function resultType inference.
#
#   This extension provides a single mixin class that enables:
#   - Simple sh:class validation instead of complex SPARQL
#   - Automatic inheritance via rdfs:subClassOf*
#   - Clear semantic documentation of container-typed entities
#
# Design:
#   These extensions are separated from the TIO baseline to:
#   - Keep TIO 3.6.0 ontology files pristine and unchanged
#   - Enable clean merging of future TIO updates
#   - Simplify proposing these additions upstream to TM Forum
#
# Compatibility:
#   - Backward compatible: All existing valid intents remain valid
#   - Forward compatible: New container-returning functions automatically inherit
#   - Zero breaking changes to TIO 3.6.0 semantics
#
# ==============================================================================

@prefix fun:  <http://tio.models.tmforum.org/tio/v3.6.0/FunctionOntology/> .
@prefix icm:  <http://tio.models.tmforum.org/tio/v3.6.0/IntentCommonModel/> .
@prefix set:  <http://tio.models.tmforum.org/tio/v3.6.0/SetOperators/> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# ==============================================================================
# SECTION 1: Core Class Definition
# ==============================================================================
#
# The fun:ContainerTyped mixin class identifies entities that are or produce
# rdfs:Container values. This enables unified validation without checking
# both explicit type and function resultType inference.
#
# ==============================================================================

fun:ContainerTyped
  rdfs:label "Container Typed Class"@en ;
  rdfs:comment """Things that are or produce Container values.

  This mixin class marks:
  - rdfs:Container instances (explicitly typed)
  - Functions with fun:resultType rdfs:Container

  Enables simple sh:class validation instead of complex SPARQL that must
  check both explicit typing AND function resultType inference.

  SHACL validation uses rdfs:subClassOf* to find all ContainerTyped instances."""@en ;
  rdf:type rdfs:Class
.

# ==============================================================================
# SECTION 2: Base Container Type Extension
# ==============================================================================
#
# rdfs:Container is the base ContainerTyped class.
# This enables any explicitly typed Container to pass validation.
#
# ==============================================================================

rdfs:Container
  rdfs:subClassOf fun:ContainerTyped .

# ==============================================================================
# SECTION 3: Set Operators Extensions (Container-returning functions)
# ==============================================================================
#
# Marks all set operator functions that return rdfs:Container as ContainerTyped.
# These functions have fun:resultType rdfs:Container in SetOperators.ttl.
#
# ==============================================================================

set:difference
  rdf:type fun:ContainerTyped .

set:intersection
  rdf:type fun:ContainerTyped .

set:union
  rdf:type fun:ContainerTyped .

set:resourcesOfType
  rdf:type fun:ContainerTyped .

set:resourcesWithProperty
  rdf:type fun:ContainerTyped .

set:resourcesWithPropertyObject
  rdf:type fun:ContainerTyped .

set:typesOfMembers
  rdf:type fun:ContainerTyped .

set:membersAfter
  rdf:type fun:ContainerTyped .

set:membersBefore
  rdf:type fun:ContainerTyped .

set:membersSameTime
  rdf:type fun:ContainerTyped .

set:membersWhile
  rdf:type fun:ContainerTyped .

set:valuesOfObjectProperty
  rdf:type fun:ContainerTyped .

# ==============================================================================
# SECTION 4: Intent Common Model Extensions (Container-returning functions)
# ==============================================================================
#
# Marks ICM functions that return rdfs:Container as ContainerTyped.
#
# ==============================================================================

icm:intentElements
  rdf:type fun:ContainerTyped .

icm:valuesOfTargetProperty
  rdf:type fun:ContainerTyped .

# ==============================================================================
# SECTION 5: Vocabulary Extension
# ==============================================================================
#
# Adds extension term to fun:Vocabulary so it is recognized by vocabulary
# validation constraints.
#
# ==============================================================================

fun:Vocabulary
  rdfs:member fun:ContainerTyped .

# ==============================================================================
# End of ContainerTypedExtension.ttl
# ==============================================================================
